abstract: "Deterministic scripts that evaluate a minimum-necessary access-policy kernel over its full input space (73,440 requests) against seven safety properties and a utility criterion, with baselines, mutation analysis, a Z3 cross-check, a Hypothesis baseline and a Cedar/OPA differential check. Synthetic data only."
keywords: [privacy-by-design, access-control, break-glass, mutation-testing, SMT, health-informatics]
